  "translation": "Today is Sunday. I go to the supermarket with my mom. We buy fruit, milk, and bread. There are many people in the supermarket. Mom asks what I want to eat. I say I want to eat apples. We buy three apples. We first buy fruit, and also want to buy drinks. I see this cup of milk tea and really want to drink it. Mom also buys me a cup of milk tea. We are all very happy. In the afternoon we go home. In the evening I will watch TV."
